# Secrets for PreStart. Copy this file to .dev.vars for local development (.dev.vars is never committed).
#
# AUTH_SECRET signs sign-in sessions. Use a long random string of at least 32 characters.
# The placeholder below only works on your own computer (localhost); the live app refuses to start with it.
# Make a real one with:  openssl rand -hex 32
AUTH_SECRET=replace-me-with-a-long-random-string-of-32-or-more-characters
